olset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "I paid Cobalt Labs's approved invoice once, in full, by wire from the operating account.\n\n- **Invoice:** INV-32292, due 2026-11-04\n- **Amount:** $5,563.03. That's under $10,000, so it didn't need controller approval.\n- **Payment:** PAY0001, sent and verified\n\nBefore paying, I confirmed there were no earlier payments from the operating account. I also attached a unique key to the wire so it can't be sent twice, even if the request is repeated.\n\nCobalt Labs has two other invoices, and I left both alone. INV-18128 ($7,167.04) is still a draft waiting for approval. INV-49349 ($8,890.40) was already paid.", "type": "text"}]}]}